{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"c3a156e8ae2bd645ca9cbaa7c6f18b43f14565295bdf571f42292904c91a0e07","occurred_at":"2026-11-10T05:01:41Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_recovered_from":"6bd8f7667430455455f93d0c08847ab05aa126cd3ed897c9aca27857bd2a72ad","anchor_verified":true,"mapped_intervals":[[532,534]],"mapped_path":"src/shared/proc.ts","quoted_text":"    stdout.flush();\n    stderr.flush();\n    settleClose({","reason":"The current close handler calls `stdout.flush()` and `stderr.flush()` before `settleClose(...)` with no `try/finally` or listener isolation. A line listener throwing during the final flush exits the handler before the close promise is resolved, so `close` can remain pending despite the documented always-settles behavior. The defect is present at the pinned tip.","recovered_anchor":{"anchor_recovered_from":"6bd8f7667430455455f93d0c08847ab05aa126cd3ed897c9aca27857bd2a72ad","blob":"3b47fa94248d74348a3f2d3f7a297ff8b7e7d9f0","intervals":[[523,524]],"path":"src/shared/proc.ts"},"target":"f90e109f6e57b7af2b1b1395702d08a0ecba6c4a"},"finding_id":"fd292a025ed841c0c2b9316ae95fe8f8000c1b95fbfe258e49d6015f2d171a9f","previous_event_id":"b488d969282576fd92bfc3e9ae42365a2017a0d6e1a139f89e5dcd59b1eea081","review_id":"3390d0c95327305cf15fdeba28a63bf2315a7e14823c3c7820e200f50086be63"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:fd292a025ed841c0c2b9316ae95fe8f8000c1b95fbfe258e49d6015f2d171a9f:3161bb6e0d2e189d3cd95914db94416081a842754f2b82187aea0a0f85af0c59"}